From 344f5c0237aeb9ec4a67aa23807e1cce34e5220c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lineage-build <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cancunf: Link camerahalserver against libcamhal_pad

extract-files.py adds libcamhal_pad.so as the first DT_NEEDED of the
camerahalserver blob (device patch 0019), so the regenerated module
lists it first in shared_libs. Mirror that here until the next
re-extraction.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 53dd163..883b452 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -51431,6 +51431,7 @@ cc_prebuilt_binary {
                 "proprietary/vendor/bin/hw/mt6855/camerahalserver",
             ],
             shared_libs: [
+                "libcamhal_pad",
                 "libudf",
                 "liblog",
                 "libutils",
